{
  "description": "#179 Tooltips with typed actions: show tooltips using the original typed actions, close the first with its cross and by tapping its title, and verify visibility/disappear callbacks. The second tooltip closes through its visibility action after 1500 ms; its disappear log must still be absent before it closes, and both status labels must change from false to true. Tapping outside is not currently supported by the runner and is not covered; whether this check is needed in this case is pending discussion. Displaying multiple tooltips simultaneously is not covered.",
